WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:08.560
Follow each shop from design to opening, and record your review of the drawings a tenant submits.

2
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:13.390
Fit-out follows every shop from the first drawings to opening day.

3
00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:18.790
The timeline shows design, handover and works for each shop against today.

4
00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:25.520
Awaiting review shows the drawings waiting for the mall. One is past its deadline.

5
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.590
Open the shop.

6
00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:35.150
The steps run from the brief to opening. Click one when the shop moves on.

7
00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:40.530
Each round of drawings is kept with its files and your comments.

8
00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:44.720
Choose Record the review.

9
00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:50.040
Approve, approve with comments, or ask them to revise and resubmit.

10
00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:54.230
Write your comments for the tenant.

11
00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:59.710
Save. The tenant sees the result in their portal right away.

12
00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:05.910
Next come the contractor, the deposit, handover and the checklists, all on this page.
